% Highlight text that is new/changed for a revision/resubmission. Wraps only
% the new wording (not the old text) in a soft red, so changes are visible
% directly in the normally compiled PDF. Use the same colour in a
% companion response-to-reviewers letter for \pointer{}, for visual
% consistency between the two documents.
\@ifundefined{\string\color@changecolor}{\definecolor{changecolor}{RGB}{220,100,100}}{}
\newcommand{\change}[1]{\textcolor{changecolor}{#1}}

